  "description": "Enterprise-grade framework for microservices architecture with CQRS, Event Sourcing, and DDD support. Ultra-simplified with Convention over Configuration. v4.5.0: Refactored security services (IJwtService, IPasswordService, IRefreshTokenService), configurable memory cache, output cache support, and modular architecture. Supports both .NET 8.0 (LTS) and .NET 9.0",
